#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md
msgid ""
"Choose a GWexpy first lesson for beginners, GW experimentalists, commissioners, "
"scientific Python users, GWpy users, or returning GWexpy users."
msgstr "初心者、重力波実験者、Commissioner、科学技術計算の Python ユーザー、GWpy ユーザー、GWexpy ユーザー向けの最初のレッスンを選びます。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:8
msgid "Start Here"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:10
msgid ""
"Choose your background to find a first lesson and a concrete result to work toward. "
"You can start with synthetic data on your own computer; detector access is not a "
"prerequisite. The suggested study times below are planning goals, excluding "
"installation."
msgstr ""
"経験に合った最初のレッスンと、そこで目指す具体的な結果を選んでください。\n"
"自分の PC で合成データから始められ、検出器へのアクセスは必要ありません。\n"
"以下の学習時間は、インストールを除く目安です。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:15
msgid "Choose a first lesson"
msgstr "最初のレッスンを選ぶ"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:20
msgid "Beginner"
msgstr "初心者"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:24
msgid ""
"Prerequisites: no Python or spectral-analysis experience assumed; install GWexpy "
"first."
msgstr ""
"前提：Python やスペクトル解析の経験は不要です。\n"
"先に GWexpy をインストールしてください。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:26
msgid ""
"Outcome: run Python code and explain a time-series plot and an ASD plot. Study goal: "
"20–30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"到達点：Python コードを実行し、時間波形と ASD の図を説明できます。\n"
"学習時間の目安：20〜30 分。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:29
msgid "GW Experimentalist"
msgstr "重力波実験者"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:33
msgid "Prerequisites: familiar with channels, sample rates, and spectra; Python may be new."
msgstr ""
"前提：チャンネル、サンプルレート、スペクトルの知識。\n"
"Python は初めてでも構いません。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:35
msgid ""
"Outcome: connect those concepts to `TimeSeries`, `TimeSeriesDict`, and a saved ASD "
"figure. Study goal: 10–20 minutes."
msgstr ""
"到達点：実験で使う概念を `TimeSeries`、`TimeSeriesDict`、保存した ASD の図に対応付けられます。\n"
"学習時間の目安：10〜20 分。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:38
msgid "Commissioner (DiagGUI · ndscope · Virgo dataDisplay)"
msgstr "Commissioner（DiagGUI / ndscope / Virgo dataDisplay）"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:42
msgid ""
"Prerequisites: comfortable choosing channels, time spans, FFT lengths, and reference "
"channels in a GUI."
msgstr "前提：GUI でチャンネル、時間区間、FFT 長、参照チャンネルを選べること。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:44
msgid ""
"Outcome: reproduce a saved-data workflow with ASD, coherence, and recorded analysis "
"settings. Study goal: 20–30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"到達点：保存データから ASD とコヒーレンスを計算し、解析条件とともに保存できます。\n"
"学習時間の目安：20〜30 分。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:47
msgid "Scientific Python User"
msgstr "科学技術計算の Python ユーザー"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:51
msgid ""
"Prerequisites: NumPy arrays, dictionaries, and basic plotting; no GWpy knowledge "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"前提：NumPy 配列、辞書、基本的な描画。\n"
"GWpy の知識は必要ありません。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:53
msgid ""
"Outcome: attach time and unit metadata to arrays and replace a per-channel spectral "
"loop with a collection method. Study goal: 10–15 minutes."
msgstr ""
"到達点：配列に時刻と単位のメタデータを付け、チャンネルごとのスペクトル計算ループをコレクションのメソッドに置き換えられます。\n"
"学習時間の目安：10〜15 分。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:56
msgid "GWpy User"
msgstr "GWpy ユーザー"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:60
msgid "Prerequisites: existing GWpy scripts or familiarity with its containers."
msgstr "前提：既存の GWpy スクリプト、または GWpy コンテナの知識。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:62
msgid ""
"Outcome: identify useful GWexpy additions and adapt an existing analysis with the "
"migration examples."
msgstr "到達点：役立つ GWexpy の追加機能を選び、移行例を使って既存の解析に取り入れられます。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:65
msgid "GWexpy User"
msgstr "GWexpy ユーザー"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:69
msgid "Prerequisites: a working GWexpy environment and a specific analysis task."
msgstr "前提：GWexpy が動く環境と、具体的な解析課題。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:71
msgid ""
"Outcome: find a task recipe or case study; use the [API "
"reference](../reference/index.md) for exact parameters."
msgstr ""
"到達点：作業に合う手順やケーススタディを見つけられます。\n"
"正確なパラメータは [API リファレンス](../reference/index.md)で確認できます。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:77
msgid "Prepare and run"
msgstr "準備して実行する"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:80
msgid "Follow [Installation](installation.md) if GWexpy is not installed yet."
msgstr "GWexpy が未導入なら[インストール](installation.md)の手順に従ってください。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:81
msgid ""
"Open the lesson matching your background. Each includes the concepts needed for its "
"first result."
msgstr ""
"経験に合ったレッスンを開きます。\n"
"最初の結果に必要な概念は各レッスン内で説明しています。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:82
msgid ""
"For a short environment check, run the [Quickstart](quickstart.md): two synthetic "
"channels produce a saved ASD figure."
msgstr ""
"短い環境確認には[クイックスタート](quickstart.md)を実行してください。\n"
"2 つの合成チャンネルから ASD の図を保存します。"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:90
msgid "Continue with your result"
msgstr "得られた結果から次へ進む"

#: ../../tutorials/getting_started.md:92
msgid ""
"Use [core lessons](index.md#core-lessons) to learn another container, or choose a "
"[case study](../how-to/case-studies/index.md) that resembles your measurement. "
"Detailed [FFT, GPS-time, and compatibility "
"conventions](../explanation/prerequisites_and_conventions.md) are available when you "
"need them."
msgstr ""
"[基礎レッスン](index.md#core-lessons)で別のコンテナを学ぶか、測定に近い[ケーススタディ](../how-to/case-"
"studies/index.md)を選んでください。\n"
"詳細が必要になったら [FFT、GPS "
"時刻、互換性の規約](../explanation/prerequisites_and_conventions.md)を参照できます。"

